  "why": "A yard with a small generator on the left, two power poles and a house on the right: the wire is strung from the generator to the house, a step-up transformer and a pole transformer are added, a storm drops a branch on the line, and the cable is finally buried in a trench seen in section. The camera opens close on the wire leaving the generator, holds mid shots of the poles and the counter, and ends wide on the lit house.",
